  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how are you holding up?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.49,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The gym has two spin classes on Saturday. One at seven, one at eleven. Which should I do?",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.49,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Depends on your style. The seven o'clock gets it out of the way and leaves your day free.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.49,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "But seven on a Saturday.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 3.03,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "True. The eleven is more relaxed, but it can split your day in half.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I tend to",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "just never go if it's late morning.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 2.88,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then the early class might suit you better. You won't have time to talk yourself out of it.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, seven. Ugh.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
